WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.139 --> 00:00:04.860
Hello, everyone, and welcome to this introductory session

2
00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:06.700
on photogrammetry.

3
00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:10.060
My name is Amir Yassin, and I will be your host.

4
00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:12.660
In this class, you learn about photogrammetry,

5
00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:16.699
the art of turning 2D pictures into 3D models.

6
00:00:16.699 --> 00:00:18.980
You learn about how to set the stage

7
00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:22.379
and take pictures correctly, what hardware

8
00:00:22.379 --> 00:00:25.420
to use for an efficient photo shoot,

9
00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:28.300
understand the limitations that are inherent with surface

10
00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:32.420
properties, and discuss several software choices

11
00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:35.859
so that you are familiar with various solutions.

12
00:00:35.859 --> 00:00:37.700
You will learn about the pros and cons

13
00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:39.899
of using photogrammetry with a smartphone

14
00:00:39.899 --> 00:00:42.840
app versus the professional way

15
00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:46.539
of using a more robust desktop application.

16
00:00:46.539 --> 00:00:50.579
For our purposes, we'll be using RealityCapture, Epic

17
00:00:50.579 --> 00:00:53.600
Games' own photogrammetry solution.

18
00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:56.520
And so if you're ready, let's start.
